{"knowledge_id": "K-GEN-0001", "process_id": "general", "kind": "cultivation", "title": "施肥通用原则", "content": "施肥应测土配方，避免单一过量偏施氮肥；追肥结合墒情与作物长势，少量多次优于一次重施。", "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "现有资料"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-GEN-0002", "process_id": "general", "kind": "cultivation", "title": "灌溉通用原则", "content": "灌溉应看天看地看苗：雨季注意排水防涝，旱季及时补水，避免大水漫灌造成沤根与养分流失。", "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "现有资料"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-GEN-0003", "process_id": "general", "kind": "cultivation", "title": "田间通风透光通用原则", "content": "合理密植并及时整枝打叶，保证田间通风透光，可降低高湿环境下病害流行的可能。", "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "现有资料"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-GEN-0004", "process_id": "general", "kind": "cultivation", "title": "田间巡查通用原则", "content": "定期巡查田间，记录病株位置与发生范围的变化；发现异常蔓延时及时咨询当地农技部门。", "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "现有资料"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-GEN-0005", "process_id": "general", "kind": "disease", "title": "高温高湿与病害流行的通识", "content": "多数真菌性病害在高温高湿、通风不良条件下容易流行。改善通风、降低田间湿度是通用的预防方向，具体病害与药剂需结合作物判断。", "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "现有资料"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-GEN-0006", "process_id": "general", "kind": "disease", "title": "土壤传播病害的通识", "content": "土传病害多与连作、土壤积水、根系损伤有关。轮作、排水、增施有机肥改良土壤是通用方向，具体病原需专业鉴定。", "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "现有资料"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-GEN-0007", "process_id": "general", "kind": "pest", "title": "常见刺吸式害虫通识", "content": "蚜虫、粉虱、蓟马等刺吸式害虫吸食汁液，可致叶片卷曲、畸形并传播病毒病。发现后应先确认种类再决定处置方式。", "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "现有资料"}
{"knowledge_id": "K-GEN-0008", "process_id": "general", "kind": "cultivation", "title": "异常情况求助指引", "content": "当病害蔓延迅速、涉及面积较大或无法判断病因时，建议拍照记录并联系当地农技推广站或植保部门寻求指导。", "region_scope": null, "regions": [{"region_code": "000000", "region_level": "national"}], "status": "approved", "source_ref": "现有资料"}
